# The Emissary in Northern San d'Oria with The Emissary Sandoria 2 completed: Helaku at status 8 plays his own
# script's 541 (not status 11); at status 11 (a GM), 557. Rival zone-in, another mission's script: the login plays
# Rumors from the West, 878.
